    "updated_at": "2017-05-05T20:57:23Z",
    "body": "I'm pretty sure that Gecko just unconditionally sets .opener when window.open targets an existing window, but it looks like Blink and WebKit does something slightly different, given that http://w3c-test.org/html/browsers/windows/browsing-context-names/choose-_parent-003.html manages to pass there.\r\n\r\n@rbyers do you know who would know what the actual Chrome behavior is here? ",
