    "created_at": "2019-01-23T16:14:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-01-23T16:14:14Z",
    "body": "If I make `popup.html` set `self.opener` to null it doesn't change anything. Setting `self.name` to \"`different`\" will make the next click open a \"popup\", however. I strongly suspect disowning is limited to the auxiliary browsing context therefore.",
